{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "moves.time_aggregation",
    "description": "Template library: the shapes of MOVES's TIME pre-aggregation (PreAggDAY.sql, PreAggMONTH.sql; InputDataManager.preAggregateExecutionDB) and of its output time step (AggregationSQLGenerator), as `onroad/model.esm` reads them (PLAN.md §7.3.63, docs/esm-conventions.md §115).\n\n`hour_day_day` and `hour_day_hour` unpack a packed hour-day the way every MOVES script does, `mod(hourDayID,10)` and `floor(hourDayID/10)` (AdjustHotelling.sql): PreAggDAY.sql writes `hourDayID = dayID` at hour 0, which no default table holds, so the cell's day and hour cannot be looked up.\n\n`preaggregation_source_type_order` is PreAggDAY.sql's and PreAggMONTH.sql's `SourceTypeOrdering`, the preference by which HourWeighting3 takes ONE source type's travel to weigh the collapsed weather by: 21 first, then by default population, 11 last. It is a constant the scripts write as an INSERT, so it is written here as code (conventions §73); `preaggregation_source_type_order_none` is the place past its end.\n\n`output_step_column` reads one column of the output relation onto the output-time-step relation `outputstep_rows` through the representative cell `mosOutputOrdinal`, as `rate_output_column` reads one onto the Rates relation.\n\n`output_step_month_slots` and `output_step_cell_slots` are how many month and cell slots each (pollutant-process, cohort, county) keeps at the output time step: the months unless `n_outputSumsMonths`; and the (day type, hour) cells at Hour, the day types (`n_rateday`) when `n_outputSumsHours` sums each day's hours (24-Hour Day, Portion of Week), and one when `n_outputSumsDays` sums them all (Month, Year). `outputstep_rows` is sized by the same product, written out because an index-set size is a metaparameter expression (PLAN.md §7.3.66).",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "hour_day_day": {
      "params": [
        "hour_day_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          "hour_day_id",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              10.0,
              {
                "op": "floor",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "hour_day_id",
                      10.0
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "hour_day_hour": {
      "params": [
        "hour_day_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "floor",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "hour_day_id",
              10.0
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "preaggregation_source_type_order": {
      "params": [
        "source_type_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "==",
            "args": [
              "source_type_id",
              21.0
            ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "source_type_id",
                  31.0
                ]
              },
              2.0,
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "==",
                    "args": [
                      "source_type_id",
                      32.0
                    ]
                  },
                  3.0,
                  {
                    "op": "ifelse",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "==",
                        "args": [
                          "source_type_id",
                          52.0
                        ]
                      },
                      4.0,
                      {
                        "op": "ifelse",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "==",
                            "args": [
                              "source_type_id",
                              61.0
                            ]
                          },
                          5.0,
                          {
                            "op": "ifelse",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "==",
                                "args": [
                                  "source_type_id",
                                  54.0
                                ]
                              },
                              6.0,
                              {
                                "op": "ifelse",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "==",
                                    "args": [
                                      "source_type_id",
                                      62.0
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  7.0,
                                  {
                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "==",
                                        "args": [
                                          "source_type_id",
                                          43.0
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      8.0,
                                      {
                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                        "args": [
                                          {
                                            "op": "==",
                                            "args": [
                                              "source_type_id",
                                              53.0
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          9.0,
                                          {
                                            "op": "ifelse",
                                            "args": [
                                              {
                                                "op": "==",
                                                "args": [
                                                  "source_type_id",
                                                  41.0
                                                ]
                                              },
                                              10.0,
                                              {
                                                "op": "ifelse",
                                                "args": [
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "==",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      "source_type_id",
                                                      42.0
                                                    ]
                                                  },
                                                  11.0,
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "==",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          "source_type_id",
                                                          51.0
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      12.0,
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          {
                                                            "op": "==",
                                                            "args": [
                                                              "source_type_id",
                                                              11.0
                                                            ]
                                                          },
                                                          13.0,
                                                          14.0
                                                        ]
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  }
                                                ]
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "preaggregation_source_type_order_none": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 14.0
    },
    "output_step_column": {
      "params": [
        "value"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "args": [],
        "semiring": "sum_product",
        "output_idx": [
          "x"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "x": {
            "from": "outputstep_rows"
          },
          "o": {
            "from": "output_rows"
          }
        },
        "join": [
          {
            "on": [
              [
                "mosOutputOrdinal",
                "outOrdinal"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "expr": {
          "op": "index",
          "args": [
            "value",
            "o"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "output_step_month_slots": {
      "params": [],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          "n_runspecmonth",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "n_outputSumsMonths",
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "n_runspecmonth",
                  1
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "output_step_cell_slots": {
      "params": [],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "n_outputSumsDays",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  "n_outputSumsDays"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "n_runspecday",
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "n_outputSumsHours",
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "n_runspecday",
                          "n_rateday"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
